      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْتَلِفُ</span></b> , said of a beast, (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَابَّة</span>, O,) <i>It eats</i>
(O, TA) [fodder, or provender, or] green herbage. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ربع</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اُعْتُلِفَ</span> [perhaps
a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْتَلَفَ</span>] (tropical:)  <i>He was a great
eater.</i> (TA.)

